  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/483",
  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">“</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">재미있는 과학 만들기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">”</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">까페를 통해 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업 아이디어를 얻고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">, </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다른 선생님의 아이디어를 그대로 활용해 보기도 하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">, </font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나름 자신의 수업스타일과 학교상황에 맞게 바꿔도 보고 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그렇게 서로의 수업시간이 좀더 반짝반짝 즐겁게 보낼 수 있었던 것 같습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이제까지 <strong>공유된 많은 수업 아이디어 중 </strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">직접 그 선생님께 듣고 싶은 수업아이디어가 있으시다면 댓글로 달아주세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그 선생님들을 오프모임에서 직접 만나 수업이야기를 서로 나눌 수 있는 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">귀중한 시간을 마련해보겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">같은 게시물에 대한 주제를 여러 선생님들께서 작성해주시면</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>선생님들의 댓글 횟수와 그 이유를 반영하여 발표해주실 선생님을 선정하려고 합니다.</strong></span></u></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">그러니 다른 선생님의 댓글과 상관없이 </font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">다시 만나고 싶은 수업아이디어가 있었다면 </font></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">꼭 댓글 달아주세요.&nbsp;<br></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--> </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">댓글 양식</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">) </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">게시판제목</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">/ </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">게시물 번호</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">(</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생략가능</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">) / </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">글제목 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">/ </font></span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다시 만나고 싶은 이유를 간략히라도 남겨주시면 감사하겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">댓글 예 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">1) </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">1</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">/ 283</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">번</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">/ </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전시장형태 프로젝트 수업</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">새학기 프로젝트 수업을 꼭 한번 해보고 싶은데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">, </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">글로만은 엄두가 안나서 직접 선생님의 경험담 및 조언을 듣고 싶네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">댓글 예 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">2) </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년말 수업아이디어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">/ 19</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">번</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">/ </font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">종이비행기 날리기 대회 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">2</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">월 수업에 바로 적용해보고 싶어서 선생님의 노하우를 배우고 싶다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회원님들의 좋은 제안 기다리겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고맙습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">.</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--> </p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
